  *              macdrv_set_cursor_position
  *
  * Sets the cursor position without generating events.  Returns zero on
- * failure, non-zero on success.
+ * failure, non-zero on success, 2 if the position was a stale one that the
+ * cursor had already moved on from and was left alone.
  */
